#: scenario:scenario_5483EDF1_439C_4106_B940_04269501A5DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f8a59c218ba3322d93c62c0b89b64e73ff8277c2db4fdd4fdda5467e5af6641
