msgid "⟪k:0⟫(What could this feeling be, I wonder?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s not quite foreboding...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Mi chiedo,⟪k:1⟫ cos’è questa sensazione che provo?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non è un presentimento...)"

#: scenario:scenario_EC2E5E21_2713_47FA_833C_90F538C46B85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a497e6e6d36a4eb36efbbe4c96cc438d6322c599228d4ed64042669959b2802
#. default-sha256: 136ec9b96f18f70b2e9316cb69938647de6fb72d9ab1cb9c0a73d00e48165a57
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EC2E5E21_2713_47FA_833C_90F538C46B85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Walking around the house at this time of night isn’t going to help anything... ⟪k:1⟫but I’m "
"not going to fall asleep just lying here...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Passeggiare per casa a quest’ora della notte non servirà a nulla... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ma non "
"riuscirò ad addormentarmi semplicemente standomene qui...)"

