#: scenario:scenario_666D8E7B_F0D9_49F6_8DD7_BE30ACD02278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b578439a093f4d91040015a2c06b70226f47dbe38797559e89dd0638b3a2f16
#. default-sha256: c9ff0a6754cad30af34caed2bce55cecba0161bea5ed62861aa5f1d70b71e90d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_666D8E7B_F0D9_49F6_8DD7_BE30ACD02278"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The "
"only sounds that could be heard in the dark corridors were the sharp pitter-patter of the rain, "
"his footsteps, and his breathing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Gli "
"unici suoni che si potevano udire nei corridoi bui erano i tuoni⟪k:17⟫e il forte scrosciare della "
"pioggia, ⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫i suoi passi e il suo respiro."

#: scenario:scenario_3E02E646_1ECF_4E68_A46C_A4416474A5CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 948c40ea85534bd0531401a873a1777c3d98c06deeb3a58b44ed21665da52137
#. default-sha256: 08743ca7d8cae74573ad9bcb5ba5af8847de0a6ce7e51ecdd706752f71c7298f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3E02E646_1ECF_4E68_A46C_A4416474A5CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he was intimately familiar with the layout of the house, that night, the hallways "
"felt like an endless labyrinth veiled in shadows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene Mell avesse una certa familiarità con la struttura della casa,⟪k:1⟫quella notte i "
"corridoi sembravano un labirinto infinito, velato dalle ombre."

#: scenario:scenario_E2DD2A30_D607_470F_A060_BC5B1E78EC2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c416c1826485d795fcd36053c5f2c090bd44e9f1380916fc7357677beba02af
#. default-sha256: 9b4fdc78bc2cb9eb132e02138ec8fa3d6d524bc40083cb5f5dfa77dab109c816
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E2DD2A30_D607_470F_A060_BC5B1E78EC2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No moonlight shone through the windows, so he naturally found himself moving cautiously, "
"despite being in his own residence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non c’era il chiaro di luna ad accompagnarlo, si ritrovò dunque⟪k:1⟫a muoversi con cautela, "
"nonostante si trovasse nella sua stessa abitazione."

#: scenario:scenario_75F434A0_B751_460F_A1DC_1D339A07B2A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cbf38a09896e99cf2a944744f3a0b40f403baec549b6f4c651819a6ca6ebd70
#. default-sha256: e87417086cd278ef7c0b17628a1ada9e7f16650639025a4b1ec9dd752399e661
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75F434A0_B751_460F_A1DC_1D339A07B2A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Keeping the palm of his hand pressed up against the chilly wall, he put one foot in front of "
"the other."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tenendo il palmo della mano premuto contro la parete fredda,⟪k:1⟫mise un piede davanti "
"all’altro."

#: scenario:scenario_2FC7DC57_B9A8_43A5_98C4_9F19FFEE95A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a52b068770993711d9a0452d36a6f1e11f5809d12e01e6d6f3428efdf3b3d94
#. default-sha256: 18bfd597c3ab23325d699caf9485a6ba8a6746c47164d8ed56d9a3ffd1c7463f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC7DC57_B9A8_43A5_98C4_9F19FFEE95A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to where was he supposed to head?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mell, of course, had no way of answering that "
"question himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma dov’era diretto?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mell, naturalmente, non aveva modo di rispondere a questa "
"domanda."

#: scenario:scenario_EB4A4C67_7CE2_42EA_9CCB_3459BDF23D1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65efbea4d25c7713d02f225a05dc270024f31399ed46654e6c9da910a8fd456b
#. default-sha256: 9b67edc73d7e66897448a590fa02b7d253e4895cdc399091e39e1e6d84528ded
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB4A4C67_7CE2_42EA_9CCB_3459BDF23D1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he had anything... ⟪k:1⟫it was guidance from above—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the path to his destination "
"lit by flashes of lightning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma se avesse dovuto... ⟪k:1⟫avrebbe pensato che qualcuno dall’alto lo stesse guidando—⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫con il percorso verso la sua destinazione illuminato dai lampi di luce."

#: scenario:scenario_815C4AA0_5DB1_406F_82A1_1EFD1D08404F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60e6a1637b40d96807525e8009a914c3e8df581d56e825d887399d8b157cc6ad
#. default-sha256: 62540a564cc33f30c905fd571a1e7ab2a9e800d4c2f239f092298e097b5bdcd4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_815C4AA0_5DB1_406F_82A1_1EFD1D08404F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps there was something else leading him along."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O forse c’era qualcos’altro che lo portava ad avanzare."

#: scenario:scenario_3A75F580_A5E3_48EC_AA57_2BFAE51E1CEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82b95611532e994c38691f71e412182681f24e7bc463bd2d424f1d05cb17602e
#. default-sha256: 9f4f6ad7693c5a9528aabe3212619c48ebbab2cb96c2f848a0266317d3f98d2b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3A75F580_A5E3_48EC_AA57_2BFAE51E1CEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he progressed with a fair bit of hesitation in his step, Mell was slowly but surely "
"drawing nearer to one room in particular."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene Mell stesse proseguendo con non poca esitazione,⟪k:1⟫si stava avvicinando lentamente "
"ma inesorabilmente ad una stanza⟪k:2⟫in particolare."

#: scenario:scenario_F42B0957_BF80_4AD8_A18B_938E16BEEA60
