#: scenario:scenario_2AE20ED4_E099_41F6_8905_7F49DC83EDBF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80b380c297ecbb366a05fc73b65f2dbdbbbc85562558b509af4ec33b89df1115
