#: scenario:scenario_9A5DA03F_23A6_47D4_9766_AE2EE423F89C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9564463137e3607f8c1fa9476fcf567c98a399635dabf98e3eae3572d515e5fe
